---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Download" description="Lumen does not have a signed app release yet.">
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Download</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      There is no signed APK to download yet.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="notice">
      The app (<a href="https://github.com/lumen-assistive/lumen-app">lumen-app</a>) exists and is
      in active development: onboarding, adaptive UI, settings, and local storage are already
      implemented and tested. A signed Android release is still missing: that lands once the minimum
      viable product (MVP) milestone is reached, when a signed APK will appear here.
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>In the meantime</h2>
    <p>
      You can follow the project's development, try the source code, or open a pull request directly
      on <a href="https://github.com/lumen-assistive">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
